flowchart TD

%% External System
HMS["HMS System (TruTech)"]

%% Entry
SYNC["syncHmsAppointments Lambda<br/>Scheduler / Manual Trigger"]

%% Appointment Queue
AQ["Appointment Queue (SQS)"]
AQDLQ["Appointment DLQ"]

%% Processor
AP["Appointment Processor Lambda"]

%% Dependency Queues
DQ["Doctor Queue (SQS)"]
PQ["Patient Queue (SQS)"]
SQ["Schedule Queue (SQS)"]

DQDLQ["Doctor DLQ"]
PQDLQ["Patient DLQ"]
SQDLQ["Schedule DLQ"]

%% Workers
DW["Doctor Worker Lambda"]
PW["Patient Worker Lambda"]
SW["Schedule Worker Lambda"]

%% Datastores
PENDING["Pending Appointments Store<br/>(Existing DynamoDB Table)"]
IDEMP["Idempotency Store<br/>(Existing DynamoDB Table)"]

%% Services
USER["User Service"]
COG["Cognito"]
ASSIGN["Doctor Assignment"]
SCHEDULE["Schedule Service"]
PACKAGE["Package Service"]

%% Flow
HMS -->|Fetch appointments| SYNC
SYNC -->|Publish appointment events| AQ

AQ --> AP
AQ --> AQDLQ

%% Processor decision
AP -->|Doctor missing| DQ
AP -->|Patient missing| PQ
AP -->|Doctor & Patient exist| SQ

%% Pending logic
AP -->|Store pending appointment| PENDING

%% Doctor worker
DQ --> DW
DQ --> DQDLQ
DW --> USER
DW --> COG
DW -->|Requeue appointment| AQ

%% Patient worker
PQ --> PW
PQ --> PQDLQ
PW --> USER
PW --> ASSIGN
PW -->|Check pending appointments| PENDING
PW -->|Requeue appointment| AQ

%% Schedule worker
SQ --> SW
SQ --> SQDLQ

SW -->|Check idempotency| IDEMP
SW --> SCHEDULE
SW --> PACKAGE
SW -->|Write idempotency record| IDEMP